          <div class="intro">
            <p>
              Lately, I&rsquo;ve been trying to understand what vision-language-action models pick up during pretraining. I&rsquo;m also interested in
              what happens when a robot has to carry out a plan and things don&rsquo;t go quite as expected.
            </p>
            <p class="phd-plans">I plan to apply for <strong>Fall&nbsp;2028</strong> PhD admission in robotics, AI, or computer science.</p>
